<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>三角带.com</title><link>https://xn--ehqs60bj46a.com/</link><description>Recent content on 三角带.com</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://xn--ehqs60bj46a.com/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>三角带型号规格怎么看？识别选型安装维护全指南</title><link>https://xn--ehqs60bj46a.com/guide/sanjiaodai-xinghao-guige/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://xn--ehqs60bj46a.com/guide/sanjiaodai-xinghao-guige/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;三角带型号规格看不懂，几乎是每位维修技工和采购新手都会踩的坑。你手里可能正攥着一根磨秃的旧三角带——橡胶侧壁发亮、字母编号被磨平，电商平台一搜全是&amp;quot;A 型&amp;quot;&amp;ldquo;B 型&amp;quot;&amp;ldquo;SPB&amp;quot;看得人发懵。买错一根，装不上事小；设备停转一天，损失才真让人头疼。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>